{"sha": "7856eb1cf56b897d6bbfb6da7ac81d351f854574c9731d9929aebba3352bbb75", "body": [" \\chapter{三角形与四边形}\\label{ch:g6:shapes}", "", "三角形和四边形是几何学中最基本的图形。本章的目标是", "认识它们的特殊类别 --- 等腰三角形、", "等边三角形、直角三角形；长方形、菱形、正方形 --- 通过", "它们的\\emph{定义性质}，并", "能用直尺和圆规精确地作出这些图形。", "", "\\section{三角形}", "", "\\begin{definition}[特殊三角形]\\label{def:g6:shapes:triangles}", "三角形 $ABC$ 有三个顶点和三条边。若满足以下条件之一，则称其为：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{等腰三角形}\\index{等腰三角形}：在 $A$ 处，当", "        $AB = AC$（两条边相等）；", "  \\item \\emph{等边三角形}\\index{等边三角形}：当", "        $AB = BC = CA$（三条边相等）；", "  \\item \\emph{直角三角形}\\index{直角三角形}：在 $A$ 处，当角", "        $\\widehat{BAC}$ 为直角。与直角相对的边 $[BC]$", "        称为\\emph{斜边}。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  % isosceles", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (2.4,0) -- (1.2,2.1) -- cycle;", "  \\draw (0.55,0.96) -- (0.72,0.86);", "  \\draw (1.85,0.96) -- (1.68,0.86);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.2,-0.15) {等腰};", "  \\node[above, font=\\small] at (1.2,2.1) {$A$};", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {$B$};", "  \\node[below right, font=\\small] at (2.4,0) {$C$};", "  % equilateral", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=4.6cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (2.4,0) -- (1.2,2.08) -- cycle;", "  \\draw (1.13,0.05) -- (1.27,-0.05);", "  \\draw (0.55,0.99) -- (0.72,0.89);", "  \\draw (1.85,0.99) -- (1.68,0.89);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.2,-0.25) {等边};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % right", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=9.2cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (2.6,0) -- (0,1.8) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[thin] (0.3,0) -- (0.3,0.3) -- (0,0.3);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (1.3,-0.15) {直角};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, rotate=-34] at (1.5,1.05) {斜边};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 三种特殊三角形。小短划表示相等的", "边；方块表示直角。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[由三边作三角形]\\label{met:g6:shapes:construct}", "作 $ABC$，使 $AB = 5$ cm，$AC = 4$ cm，$BC = 3$ cm：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 用直尺画线段 $[AB]$，其长为 $5$ cm；", "  \\item 以 $A$ 为圆心、$4$ cm 为半径画圆弧", "        （即 $4$ cm 是圆上各点到 $A$ 的距离）；", "  \\item 以 $B$ 为圆心、$3$ cm 为半径画圆弧；", "  \\item 两段圆弧的交点即为点 $C$；将其与 $A$、", "        $B$ 相连。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (5,0);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (3.2,2.4);", "  \\draw[thick] (A) -- (B);", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] (A) -- (C);", "  \\draw[thick, omThm] (B) -- (C);", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (C) arc[start angle=36.9, delta angle=22, radius=4];", "  \\draw[omDef, thin] (C) arc[start angle=36.9, delta angle=-22, radius=4];", "  \\draw[omThm, thin] (C) arc[start angle=126.9, delta angle=22, radius=3];", "  \\draw[omThm, thin] (C) arc[start angle=126.9, delta angle=-22, radius=3];", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[below left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (1.2,1.5) {$4$ cm};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (4.6,1.4) {$3$ cm};", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.5,0) {$5$ cm};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 用圆规作三角形：顶点 $C$ 是", "两段圆弧的交点。（在\\cref{ch:g7:triangles}中", "将学习何时能作出这样的三角形。）}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{四边形}", "", "\\begin{definition}[特殊四边形]\\label{def:g6:shapes:quadrilaterals}", "四边形有四个顶点和四条边。若它是：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{长方形}\\index{长方形}：当其四个角", "        均为直角；", "  \\item \\emph{菱形}\\index{菱形}：四条边", "        长度均相等；", "  \\item \\emph{正方形}\\index{正方形}：同时满足两者，即四个角都是直角", "        \\emph{且}四条边相等。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[对角线的性质]\\label{prop:g6:shapes:diagonals}", "在这些四边形中，两条对角线相交于它们的", "公共中点，并且：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 在长方形中，对角线\\emph{长度相等}；", "  \\item 在菱形中，对角线\\emph{互相垂直}；", "  \\item 在正方形中，两者同时成立。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{proposition}", "\\admitted", ""]}